    "notes": {
        "248bf851-dee7-4aa5-b3b1-d8b3865c7ac6": {
            "x": 64,
            "y": 640,
            "width": 900,
            "height": 260,
            "content": "## ⚠️ Test data assumption\n\n`onedrive.NewFile` has no properties — it watches the whole of `/me/drive` for the connected\naccount — and the cleanup deletes whatever item id the trigger reports. The E2E account's\nOneDrive must therefore be reserved for this flow; nothing else may create files in it while\nthe flow runs.\n\nThe upload goes to the OneDrive root (no folder binding), which is exactly what the trigger's\n`/me/drive/root/delta` watches.\n\n`Wait 1m` lets the Graph subscription propagate before the file is created — do not remove it.\nGraph webhook notifications take up to ~5 minutes, hence the 600 s AfterAll timeout.\n\nThe account needs `Files.ReadWrite.All` (trigger + upload) and `Sites.Read.All` (Make API Call)."
        }
    }
